Chris is a great guide! Thank you so much for your kind words we'll definitely pass them on!
Best;
-Miller's Landing

Sam; Thank you so much for your kind words! You guys were a blast to fish and kayak with, and while the weather accessing the National Park can get a little bumpy as it's exposed to the Gulf of Alaska, once we get into Aialik Bay it calms right down.  It was a pleasure having you guys on board, after speaking with the crew I know the sentiment was that we had as much fun as you guys did :) Thank you so much for coming along and we hope to see you sometime in the future!
Best;
-Chance Miller.
